---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Advertising & Ads | B Tecky" description="Advertising disclosure and information about how advertisements may appear on B Tecky.">
<main><section class="legal-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY & LEGAL / B TECKY</p><h1 class="display">Advertising & Ads</h1><p>How advertising may appear on B Tecky.</p><small>Last updated: 2 November 2026</small></div></section><article class="container legal-content">
<section><h2>Advertising disclosure</h2><p>B Tecky may display advertisements served by Google AdSense or other advertising partners. Advertisements are separate from editorial content, tools and recommendations. Advertising does not determine the results shown by the Arcade tools.</p></section>
<section><h2>Cookies and advertising choices</h2><p>Advertising partners may use cookies or similar technologies for ad delivery, frequency capping, measurement and personalization, subject to applicable law and your regional choices. You can review or change Google's ad personalization choices through <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</p></section>
<section><h2>Advertising standards</h2><p>We do not publish advertising account credentials, private account settings or internal configuration details on this page. Technical advertising declarations required for platform compliance are maintained separately from the site's visitor-facing content.</p></section>
<section><h2>Questions</h2><p>For advertising or privacy questions, use our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p></section>
</article></main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.legal-hero{padding:76px 0 48px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f6ff,#fff)}.legal-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,4.8rem);letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:15px 0}.legal-hero p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:700px;color:#667085;line-height:1.7}.legal-hero small{color:#667085}.legal-content{max-width:850px;padding-block:48px 90px}.legal-content section{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e6e9f0}.legal-content h2{font:800 1.35rem var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.03em}.legal-content p{color:#475467;line-height:1.8}.legal-content a{color:#315efb;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}</style>